      "message": "test(examples): pin the wrapped A-axis catalog requirements\n\nKeep the missing-case regression test for the next worker.\nThe pin fails on upstream/main because wrapped.camproj is absent.\nRotary Contour refuses an X-axis workpiece. Issue #3000 tracks this limit.\nNo catalog assets or generator changes are included.\n\nRefs #2869",
